Good morning, writers! This latest release includes a major overhaul of the Import window's backend. You'll find that adaptive scanning now runs a lot more smoothly, and returns much more sensible notes.

For those interested, a lot of the work that was done here includes changing from a purely repetitive approach to more deeply analyzing the text according to TF-IDF and Shannon entropy calculations. (Say that five times fast.)

A deep dive is available below for those who are interested. For those with less time, just know that your notes will be split up in a much more *human*-feeling way from now on.

